  "job_B19.5_20251003_114444": {
    "chunk_text": "enne. SE14A4 \u00dea he \u00fe\u00e6t ne ge\u00feafode, \u00fea het he hine l\u00e6dan to beheafdunga. SE14A5 \u00d0a he \u00fea l\u00e6ded w\u00e6s, \u00fea geh\u00e6lde he sumes cempan wif mid his gebede, seo w\u00e6s \u00e6r fif gear SE14A7 \u00de\u00e6s cempan noma w\u00e6s Cerealis, ond \u00fe\u00e6s wifes nama w\u00e6s Salustia. SE14A8 Ond he ge\u00ferowode martirdom mid an twentigum mannum, ond se cempa mid his wife. SE14B1 On \u00f0one ylcan d\u00e6g bi\u00fe sancte Ciprianes tid \u00fe\u00e6s bisceopes, se w\u00e6s in Kartagine \u00fe\u00e6re SE14B4 Galerius se aldorman, beforan him he het ar\u00e6dan \u00fe\u00e6s kaseres dom \u00fe\u00e6t he sceolde SE14B7 \u00dea se dom ar\u00e6ded w\u00e6s, \u00f0a andswarode him Ciprianus and cw\u00e6\u00fe, gode \u00feanc. SE14B8 \u00dea hine man l\u00e6dde to \u00fe\u00e6re stowe \u00fee hine man beheafdude, \u00f0a gesomnode he miclo SE14B12 \u00d0a bebead he \u00fe\u00e6t mon heolde his m\u00e6denu cl\u00e6ne. SE14B13 Ne gemde he na swa swy\u00f0e hu he on morgenne ar\u00e6fnede \u00f0\u00e6s unhyran cwelres hand, swa SE14B16 \u00dea on morgenne \u00f0a ar\u00e6fnode he \u00fea beheafdunga, ond he het \u00f0\u00e6m cwelre syllan XXV SE14B18 \u00d0a \u00e6fter feaum dagum swealt se ealdorman \u00fee hyne martyrode. SE15A1 On \u00f0one XV d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00fees bi\u00f0 sancti Valerianys \u00ferowung \u00f0\u00e6s martyres, \u00feone se refa SE15A3 \u00d0a he \u00feam wi\u00fe",
